{"agent":"bg48","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"If the gate has no prior `chunk_findings` (for example, the first delta review of a gate), `_delta_kept` returns `None`. `_say_result` then takes the `kept is None` branch and numbers each reviewer’s findings from `1`, so with two reviewers the second reviewer’s finding is printed as `#1`. The record after the round contains both reviewers’ findings as entries 1 and 2 — the list `review triage --finding N` addresses — so a user who saw the second reviewer’s output as `#1` and runs `review triage --finding 1` marks the first reviewer’s finding instead. Delta mode should use an empty list when `chunk_findings` is absent, not `None`, so the first reviewer’s new findings seed the kept list for later reviewers.","digest":"3d22abf7af15a668","family":"deepseek","location":"run.py:_delta_kept","reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","severity":"HIGH","title":"run.py:_delta_kept"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":1,"diff_chars":11059,"diff_sha":"5b4b4eaa0234dd8142b7feefe5c53b6e88494e7709d257f0bacd0dcb5b6ae3b7","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":0.7,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"aaf165b9d61e4d60","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B32ce00713b.critic.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261107T235312Z-33f4621d.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"48d3c2d44b7eb388d97f0f1942492292de039175","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/review/records.py":"100644 55df4251f2ed273181083199ab2e31a4aedc316a","ddflow/api/review/run.py":"100644 75c056afe74d342505f43025f5b9143f0eb37e09","tests/test_review_delta.py":"100644 1ef40c0dbfb8ad6b4714ec2e29b9dda0b1a8b4f5"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":